      {
        "body": "dettivo-qa drive hotkeys_hyprland fails 5/5 live at its new double-tap step. The keys.rs 40 ms per-edge sleeps put ~380 ms between the tap's release and the second press, outside the 300 ms window, so the take finishes instead of locking (proven with the CLI verbs: 0.15 s gap locks, 0.38 s does not). The drive's lost-release step (R4's required QA drive) never runs. The daemon behaves as specified. Evidence: .flow/tmp/qa-fn-82-hold-to-talk-that-survives-lost/s7-hotkeys-hyprland-drive-run{1..5}.log, s7-double-tap-gap-cli.log; memory .flow/memory/bug/integration/maintainer-cant-prove-the-double-tap-2026-11-01.md (surface: crates/dettivo-qa/src/scenarios/hotkeys_hyprland.rs)",
